\\\">Example: Are there any pencils in the house?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Questions with <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where is \u2026 ? <br/>Where's \u2026 ?  <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: Where's the notebook?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where are \u2026 ?  <br/><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: Where are the erasers?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pencil"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an object we use for writing or drawing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I use your pencil? I want  to write a note. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are the words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "eraser"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small object we use to remove pencil marks"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you have an eraser? I need to change something."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pencil sharpener "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an object we use to make pencils ready to write"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need a pencil sharpener to use this pencil."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le03ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kitchen"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room where people eat and cook food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The fridge is in the kitchen."}